# Issue #2903 (P23, greenfield flag day): a principal payload is only its
# ciphertext beside its state, so requests drop `cipherSuite` and
# `ciphertextHash` and responses drop the payload record's other fields.
# Remove these exact diagnostics as soon as main contains the new contract.
GET /containers/{containerId}/writer-projection removed the required property `policyEvidence/organizationPayloads/items/payload/anyOf[#/components/schemas/PrincipalStatePayloadResponse]/cipherSuite` from the response with the `200` status

